meta {
  name: กองทุน (กรมจัดส่ง)
  seq: 20
}

auth {
  mode: inherit
}

vars:pre-request {
  ~msid: 0
  ~reqid: 601
  ~ojid: 0
  ~ojid2: 0
  ~sslid: 0
  ~baid: 0
}

docs {
  คำขอส่งเงินเข้ากองทุนฯ (กรมจัดส่ง) = rtid 601. Login with "login admin" first.
  
  Set the folder vars (Folder settings > Vars):
  - msid  = mgmtSendSKInfo.id (round)
  - reqid = the round's 601 requestInfo.id (from "02 get 601 of round")
  - ojid / ojid2 = seekerDtl.id of seekers in the 601 (from "03 get 601 seekers")
  - sslid = sendSeekerList.id of the seeker to cancel (from "08 get round seekers")
  - baid  = bankInfo.id (cheque only)
  
  Flow: 01 send round -> 04 พิจารณา -> 05 approve each level -> (status 12) -> 10/11 pay -> 8 when everyone paid.
  Errors come back as HTTP 400 {"non_field_errors": ["ERR_..."]}.
}
